      "date": "2026-07-28",
      "summary": "Added cards as a public prop with a working remixer panel. The originally suggested activeIndex/depth/rotation/duration props don't exist here - card positions come from a fixed hand-tuned per-slot table (getSlotProps), not a linear depth/rotation formula - so they were dropped rather than shipping non-functional controls.",
